# Local AI MCP

MCP server (TypeScript, stdio) that manages local model runtimes: Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp, Docker Model Runner, MLX, vLLM, Foundry Local, OpenAI-compatible servers, and opt-in hosted Moonshot.

This repo is PUBLIC: never commit secrets, tokens, private hostnames, or filled-in .env files.

## Project structure

- `src/index.ts`: stdio entry; `src/server.ts`: createServer wiring
- `src/providers/`: adapters (extend BaseProvider / OpenAICompatibleProvider in base.ts), routing in manager.ts
- `src/tools/`: MCP tools (registerTool + annotations + outputSchema), resources and prompts
- `src/fit.ts`: VRAM/KV-cache fit math; `src/hardware/`: per-OS GPU/RAM probes
- `src/__tests__/`: vitest, fully offline (mockFetch / FakeProvider in support.ts)

## Conventions

- Conventional commits (feat:, fix:, chore:, docs:)
- Bump with `npm version <bump> --no-git-tag-version` (syncs server.json and mcpb/manifest.json); CI tags and publishes
- Implicit routing must use ProviderManager.select() and stay local-only
- After changing tools run `npm run gen:tools`; list new env vars in .env.example
- New adapters join the conformance suite in src/__tests__/conformance.test.ts
- Checks: npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm test
